===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# a [[protein]] derived through partial [[hydrolysis]] of the [[collagen]] extracted from [[animal]] [[skin]], [[bone]]s, [[cartilage]], [[ligament]]s, etc.
# an [[edible]] [[jelly]] made from this material
# a thin, [[translucent]] [[membrane]] used for [[theatrical]] [[lighting]] [[effect]]s

